{
	"nodes":[
		{
			"id":"6c0f5a7f72a20a21",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"1. ✏️ DESIGN & SPEC\n   └── You create:\n        - PCB schematics & layout (Gerber, BOM)\n        - Case & plate CAD models\n        - Product specs & features\n        - Branding & packaging ideas",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":745,
			"y":-400,
			"width":455,
			"height":180
		},
		{
			"id":"8ad009820f3bfb68",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"2. 📤 REQUEST FOR QUOTE (RFQ)\n   └── You send files to OEM:\n        - PCB files, CAD files, BOM\n        - Quantities (proto + production)\n        - Assembly/testing requirements",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1380,
			"y":-400,
			"width":455,
			"height":180
		},
		{
			"id":"5c78b758e9b36212",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"\n3. 💬 QUOTATION & FEEDBACK\n   └── OEM replies with:\n        - Pricing (prototype & mass production)\n        - MOQs (Minimum Order Quantities)\n        - Lead times\n        - DFM feedback (Design for Manufacturability)",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":745,
			"y":-120,
			"width":455,
			"height":200
		},
		{
			"id":"e2b57a7dbfc03069",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"\n4. 🔁 REVISIONS (optional)\n   └── You make changes based on DFM or pricing feedback",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1380,
			"y":-120,
			"width":455,
			"height":200
		},
		{
			"id":"570e0ef404fe98a0",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"\n5. 🔬 PROTOTYPE PHASE\n   └── OEM builds:\n        - PCB prototypes\n        - CNC/3D printed enclosures\n        - Optional: full keyboard assembly sample",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":745,
			"y":180,
			"width":455,
			"height":150
		},
		{
			"id":"162150c7c60450c9",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"6. 🧪 SAMPLE TESTING\n   └── You receive prototype:\n        - Test fit, finish, electrical function\n        - Document bugs/improvements\n        - Approve or revise",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1380,
			"y":180,
			"width":455,
			"height":150
		},
		{
			"id":"82c2cd6ae24f25c8",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"7. ✅ PRODUCTION APPROVAL\n   └── Once the prototype passes:\n        - You give written approval\n        - You finalize order quantity\n        - Pay deposit (typically 30–50%)",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":750,
			"y":440,
			"width":460,
			"height":160
		},
		{
			"id":"15820342c228a1e4",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"8. 🏭 MASS MANUFACTURING\n   └── OEM:\n        - Orders materials\n        - Runs production (PCB, CNC, injection molding, etc.)\n        - Performs assembly & QC",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1380,
			"y":440,
			"width":455,
			"height":160
		},
		{
			"id":"0e1a72e2034b4e4f",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"9. 🧾 FINAL PAYMENT & SHIPPING\n   └── You:\n        - Pay remaining balance\n        - Arrange shipping (FOB, DDP, etc.)\n        - Receive final products",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":750,
			"y":700,
			"width":460,
			"height":160
		},
		{
			"id":"f147883742eb97d4",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"10. 📦 DELIVERY TO WAREHOUSE / FULFILLMENT\n    └── Products arrive:\n         - To you, a warehouse, or 3PL\n         - Ready for retail, Kickstarter, etc.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1380,
			"y":700,
			"width":455,
			"height":160
		}
	],
